loongoffice (26.2.6.3-1.lnd.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Rebase LoongOffice customizations onto LibreOffice 26.2.6.3.
  * Update dictionary, help, and translation locks to the upstream gitlinks.
  * Refresh the Simplified Chinese rehearsal timing patch with only 16 entries.
  * Adapt rehearsal timing to the upstream canvastools namespace and preserve
    upstream menu styles while removing community help entries.
  * Keep the libpng LoongArch LSX implementation, with per-file SIMD flags.
  * Drop the obsolete EPM architecture naming customization from this branch.
  * Require GNU Make 4.2, GTK 3.24, and ATK 2.36; keep experimental Rust features
    disabled so the offline package does not require Cargo inputs.
  * Replace the obsolete EPM build.sh workflow with dpkg-buildpackage.
  * Retain the isolated single-package installation, prebuilt OFD extension,
    pinned batch print sources, and Loongnix dwz workaround.

 -- wangxin <wangxxin0625@gmail.com>  Thu, 10 Sep 2026 17:00:00 +0800

loongoffice (25.8.7.3-1.lnd.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Build the all-in-one package directly with distro-pack-install and DESTDIR.
  * Bundle a verified prebuilt OFD OXT without publishing its source code.
  * Build the pinned batch print project from source without network.
  * Prepare a self-contained orig tarball for offline system-source builds.
  * Replace the bundled batch print executable with distribution Python modules.
  * Use debhelper-generated MIME, desktop, and icon cache maintenance hooks.
  * Let LibreOffice autogen.sh bootstrap the build instead of dh_autoreconf.
  * Use the configure-derived loongoffice installation directory name.
  * Prepare and validate dictionary, help, and translation submodules for
    offline builds, including source trees carried over without Git metadata.
  * Prepare and verify LibreOffice external tarballs as explicit offline input.
  * Select and validate the LibreOffice tarball download client explicitly.
  * Keep LoongOffice commands, user profiles, libraries, and Python UNO usage
    isolated from a distribution LibreOffice installation.
  * Brand Bash completion and AppStream component IDs as LoongOffice-only.
  * Provide, replace, and conflict with every legacy LoongOffice split package
    whose files and functionality are merged into this package.
  * Skip the incompatible optional dwz debug-information optimization on
    Loongnix for the private LibreOffice ELF set.
  * Install desktop integration from the generated LoongOffice sysui path and
    fail packaging when its required inputs are absent.

 -- Loongson <service@loongson.cn>  Mon, 31 Aug 2026 21:40:00 +0800

